WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.640
How does Chimera look?

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.570
She is eating, but I still think
she's under the weather.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.180
Maybe we should take her to the vet.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.900
She probably just ate too much.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.710
I don't know.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.910
Although Rikka was feeding her lots
for what she called "Project Super-Size."

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.910
Honestly. So, where is Rikka?

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.180
I think she's still sleeping.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.770
Arise, Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.800
The time of awakening is nigh!

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:37.800
The Light! The Light Beings are
roasting me alive!

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.500
Yuta, give me darkness!

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.520
Roast to your heart's content.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.250
What is it?

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.640
Nothing.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.010
Togashi, morning!

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.890
Good morning.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.620
It's the start of the second term.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.040
Yeah!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.980
Where's Rikka?

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.270
Well, we were leaving for school...

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:40.620
The Superior Contract...
of Twilight

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:41.320
and she ran off by herself
saying she was going ahead.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.720
Really.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.220
Buongiorno!

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.600
Nibutani?

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.600
Nibutani.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.930
Ciao! How was your long vacation?

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.990
Nibutani, you know...

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:57.210
You seem to get a little weird
every time there's a new term.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.650
See you in second term!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.790
They're talking about you, Nibutani.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:05.330
Morisummer is as funny as ever!

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:06.790
Kumin-senpai.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:07.790
Huh?

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:10.980
Yes, I only have eyes for you.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.960
Yikes! Really, who are you?!

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:16.780
I only have eyes for you, Kumin-senpai.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:21.500
I am devoted to you, Kumin-senpai!

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.370
An exchange student?

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:24.850
Probably.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:26.600
Bye.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:27.910
See ya.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:31.690
See? She wasn't like this before
summer vacation.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.810
You probably shrank.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:35.810
Hey, Togashi.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.040
Yo.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.070
What are you staring at?

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:45.910
Yikes!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:50.550
You stare longingly after
Rikka without saying a word to

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:53.070
each other right after summer vacation.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.540
Did you break up?

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.150
No!

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:58.420
Did your love cool off in the hot summer?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.830
You're wrong! If you wanna know,
it's the opposite!

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:05.230
The opposite? Do you mean,
you spent the entire summer...

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.900
Did you defile my master?!

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.820
No! Where did you come from anyway?!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:09.720
How about it?

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:12.990
Why are you in this press corps?
And you're back to normal.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:16.400
It's all right. There's no need to be shy.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.830
Statistically speaking, the second year
of high school is when...

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.460
I-i-is that true?!

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.180
That's just what the statistics say.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:28.360
I don't want to discuss
it! Anyway, you're wrong!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:29.910
Then what's the deal?

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:31.780
Nothing.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.830
It's just that Rikka's been
acting off all morning.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:39.170
You didn't treat my master cruelly, I trust?

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:44.510
Hey, did you talk with Shichimiya
in an overly friendly way again?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.500
No, no, no! I know I'm dense,
but I know better than that.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.050
In fact, Rikka practically goes over
to visit her every day.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.180
Really?

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:57.400
They've really hit it off since then.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.230
Rikka! Hey, Rikka!

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:05.490
Togashi wants to whisper
sweet nothings to you.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.110
Wha-?!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.370
Rikka?

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:10.440
Master.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.570
I see what you mean. She is a bit off.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.490
Nah, anyone would wanna run from that.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:17.250
Blow to smithereens, fruitful offline life!

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.630
You mean Wicked Lord Shingan?

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:20.840
Yeah.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:22.760
Do you know anything about it?

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:25.250
You just go home.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.460
Ow!

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:28.210
You go home!

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.250
Who is in the most pain?

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.390
Did she mention anything out of the ordinary?

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:36.220
She always comes with me on my angel hunts.

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:39.470
She's helping out since I helped revive
the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:41.430
But...

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:41.940
But?

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:46.730
She said she was thinking of entering
a Superior Contract with Hero.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.270
Superior Contract?

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.900
Yeah. Now that the Dark Flame Dragon
has been revived,

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:53.650
she thinks it's necessary
as a contract holder.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:55.940
Superior Contract?

00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:01.160
If memory serves me, those two
are bound by a Lover's Contract.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.210
An Superior Contract would have to mean...

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:12.010
Wh-why are you turning red?!
Get your mind out of the gutter!

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:15.840
What's that?! You're the
one who's turning red!

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:18.020
You sure have a dirty mind for a freshman!

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.380
Moron! I do not!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.820
My mind is clean!

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:24.640
I know you're lying!

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:28.270
I bet you were imagining Takanashi
taking off her clothes and...

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:29.350
Yuta.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:30.310
Don't say it! Don't say it! Don't say it!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:31.850
Ow! Ow! Ow!
Don't say it! Don't say it! Don't say it!

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:32.780
Not that.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.450
She meant kissing.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.610
O-of course.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.670
I'm home!

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:41.250
Welcome back!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:43.030
How is Chimera?

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.960
She's acting the same as earlier.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:48.010
KISSING, HOW BOYS FEEL

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.350
Rikka?

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:59.260
Yes? What?

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.940
Nothing, just seeing if you were here.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:09.650
You didn't have to come along, Togashi.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:11.390
How come?

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.270
Because we have girl talk to do.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:15.860
Isn't that right, Takanashi?

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:16.370
Yes.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:20.290
So, this is the famous Faerie Spring?

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:24.430
Any type of spirit may live here. Caution.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:26.130
I got it, Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:30.120
I hope you're not planning to butt in
where you're not wanted again.

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.040
Did you hear anything?

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.920
Maybe! C'mon, Takanashi. Let's go.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:35.630
Yes.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:41.630
So, why are you here?

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:42.310
Huh?

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:46.190
Was there any particular reason
we needed to come to a bath house?

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:48.080
It does the job.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:52.320
This way, Togashi can't interfere
and Takanashi can't run away.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:54.700
Plus there are no weapons to attack with.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:55.660
Eat this!

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.700
Although I didn't factor in
that this idiot might come along.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.400
It serves you right.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.860
Deko, come over here. They have funny baths!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.780
What? What is it?

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:11.290
Ooh, it's a sonic training area!

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.330
Master, you must come!

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.010
When my meditation is done.

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.710
Honestly.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.840
But this works. Now's my chance.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:20.910
MIKAN
Soak away the daily fatigue
in our four seasons bath.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.880
Takanashi, what are you doing?

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:28.350
I am in deep concentration
to prepare for the inevitable.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:30.560
The inevitable?

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:32.530
That I cannot say.

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:34.140
Do you mean...

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:35.410
The Superior Contract?

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:40.210
You're so obvious!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.990
Nibutani, are you reading my thoughts?!

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.610
It's a Morisummer miracle!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:48.670
Don't call me that!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.830
Danger! Break away!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.040
I'm surprised.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.970
Ooh, dynamite!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.250
I will join this battle!

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:58.670
Itty bitty.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.420
Uh... Pretty!

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.890
You shut up!

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.550
Want some, Mjolnir Hammer?

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:08.860
You want to kill me?!

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.360
He said that?

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:13.520
Yes. When the Dark Flame Dragon
was brought back to life,

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.360
my part of the Contract
became more solidified.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:19.160
Yet nothing has changed.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.090
Stay!

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:23.330
He restricts my activities.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.620
Solve this correctly, and you can have this.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:29.500
And he believes that I will obey
if he rewards me with something black.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:30.530
Wake up!

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.970
And he is heavy-handed with me
in spite of my contractual status.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:38.350
He probably thinks that saying
"dark" will please me!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.290
Ooh, Master has gone wild!

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.810
That's why you want to enter
a Superior Contract?

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:49.330
Yes. Otherwise it will never change.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.170
Now the Dark Flame Dragon has been revived,

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:54.820
the Contract must be revised accordingly.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:57.660
But...

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:05.820
The more I think about it,
the more I feel I might dissolve away.

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:09.210
That is why I have a favor to ask.

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:10.410
A favor?

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.460
I want you to watch me
to make sure I don't run.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:14.550
Rikka.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:15.990
Master.

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:18.380
Understood, Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.510
Stop that.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.520
Someone is in love with you?!

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.370
Yeah. Remember how
I had a lifeguard job at the pool?

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:32.340
That's when it happened.
It's someone named Chihiro.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.960
That's great!

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.710
So your time has come!

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:38.550
You're wrong! I'm not bragging about it.

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.300
I'm devoted to Kumin-senpai all the way!

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.470
That's why I worked
all through summer vacation.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:46.580
So I could buy her a present. But for what?!

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.120
Makoto?

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:54.960
Chihiro...

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:56.520
"Chihiro"?

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.590
WHAT?!

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.670
Makoto, I've missed you.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:04.330
You mean, Chihiro is a...?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.260
Chihiro.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:06.560
Chihiro?!

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.710
Makoto, we must be joined by
the Red Thread of Fate

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:12.330
to run into each other in a place like this.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:15.400
Ah, just stop. I am... I am...

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.510
Isshiki!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:25.100
MEN

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.640
Isshiki, I wish you happiness.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.380
You didn't find out anything?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:42.000
That's right. This one time,
Takanashi was very tight lipped.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.500
She said she'd tell you herself.

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:44.760
Herself?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:49.360
Yeah. She wants you to
come here after school.

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.600
BASE
COME HERE

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:56.420
Be sure to go. She looked serious.

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.320
Sure.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:11:59.280
Bye.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:01.400
Rikka.

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:04.890
How'd it go?

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:09.290
That was nothing for me.
It was almost too easy.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:11.640
What?

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:15.790
Nothing. I was just thinking how much
you really love us, Morisummer.

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.900
Don't call me that.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.760
You're supposed to respect me.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.810
Master, that's crooked.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:52.200
Mjolnir Hammer, it's almost time.
We have to hide.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.830
I know that!

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:56.360
It is time, Master. Godspeed!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.740
Wait! I can't go through with it!

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.420
Master.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.260
Y-you traitors!

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:11.640
Wicked Lord Shingan, you asked us
to make sure you didn't run.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:12.990
I changed my mind!

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.940
There are many other
higher contract categories

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.380
in Wicked Lord Shingan's
selection of Lover's Contracts!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.650
There is a diverse variety...

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.730
Wicked Lord Shingan is all-powerful!

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:26.490
You can't run away now.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.640
That's what you've always done, right?

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.880
You conquered your fear...

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.370
Met Hero...

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.280
Dove into his arms...

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:47.950
And entered into a binding contract with him.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.270
You did all this because
Wicked Lord Shingan is all-powerful.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.730
You made it this far because of
Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.230
So you have to believe in him.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.230
Believe in your own strength.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.230
Sophia.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:15.180
Wicked Lord Shingan really is all-powerful.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.640
The emotions have such power.

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:34.680
I will give you all the power I've got.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:48.930
Deko.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:52.200
Stop taking so long!
Togashi will arrive soon.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:55.180
I am fully aware of that
without your information!

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:57.830
Wicked Lord Shingan, it is
all the natural logic of the world.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:00.000
He's here!

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:01.910
Quick, hide.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:18.720
Hey, what's up? Did you make a new discovery?

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.850
Y-Yuta Togashi!

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:24.460
Or should I say, Dark Flame Master.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.940
Or should I say, Ghelzonianses!

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.820
Pick one and stick with it.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.010
I command you to enter into a
Superior Lover's Contract with

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.950
myself and Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:36.910
Superior Contract?

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:41.470
If you cannot determine its significance,
then you are a fool!

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.570
Surely you don't mean... But why?

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:49.530
My demands have been stated.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.870
The hows and whys of the world
mean nothing to the Wicked Lord!

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:53.450
But...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.870
Will you or will you not? Choose!

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:09.510
Just kidding. I didn't mean to do that!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.580
Yuta.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:25.580
Perfect defense.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.230
Shall we go?

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:27.750
No!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.530
Hold my shoulders so I can't escape.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.960
Got you!

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:47.920
Look.

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:51.940
No! I was momentarily possessed
by something dark, that's all.

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.530
I'm all right now.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:54.910
You're sure?

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.480
I'm sure.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.420
I don't get it.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.950
I want to get closer to you.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:29.540
I want to be with you,
but it's so embarrassing.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.780
It makes me feel so scared and embarrassed.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:38.450
I'm too scared. Why am I so scared?

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:46.300
Rikka.

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:50.120
We already talked about this.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.140
There's no need to force ourselves to change.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.340
It's not healthy.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.550
But I am bound to you for eternity.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:17:59.740
I am bound to you by contract.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.540
That is why Sophia entrusted
everything to me.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.690
Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:12.110
I must consummate the emotion
she entrusted to me!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.320
That is my mission.

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:18.230
I'm sorry. I thought I
knew how hopeless I was...

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.510
...but I'm worse at it than I thought.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.260
You really thought it through.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:25.580
Yuta.

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.210
Rikka, remember how you told me?

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:31.460
We would spend fun time together...

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:33.560
...and go home together.

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.560
You said that nothing could make you happier.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.340
Yeah.

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.850
I feel the same.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:49.550
We live in the same apartment,
go to school together...

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.080
...go home together, eat together....

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:57.040
...play video games together,
get mad, and laugh.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:02.240
It could feel like such a drag,
and then feel like such a relief.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:06.080
Every one of those things is happiness.

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:09.660
It's better than any hugs and kisses

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.570
or other things that lovers do.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:15.150
It makes me happy, and it makes me
feel very close to you.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:19.980
Rikka, you will always
be the only one for me.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:24.930
Yuta...

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:29.710
Yuta, Yuta, Yuta!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.900
Besides, it is gradually changing.

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.530
We couldn't do stuff like this a year ago.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:39.110
Yeah.

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:43.120
In the beginning it was pinkies.
Next we held hands.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.950
It's happening slowly, but it is changing.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:29.310
HOME

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:31.790
Oh, that's me.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:32.710
Deko.

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.290
I knew this would happen.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.360
What?! Chimera did what?

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:37.130
Yeah!

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.630
She had babies!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.280
Say what?!

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.570
Come home quick, Big Brother!

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.200
Got it! I'll be right there!

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:46.740
Babies?

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.540
Yeah, our family is growing.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.680
Ooh! Chimera Two!

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.440
"Two," nothing. There are six of 'em.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.860
Six! A chimaeric beast army!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.750
Yeah!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.910
Hold it.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:02.070
You're not going to let it
end like this, are you?!

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:05.120
Why are you mad at me? Why are you here?

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:08.180
Do it! I practically raised you two!

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:11.550
The least you could do
is to let us watch you do it!

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:13.620
"Watch you do it?"

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.020
Do not make it sound so vulgar!

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.360
Yuta, escape!

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:21.280
Right!

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.680
She's getting away! Hold it right there, you!

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.590
Master!

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.660
What will happen next?

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.420
What will become of Rikka's chunibyo?

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:37.100
What will become of our love?

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:40.730
Who knows?

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:46.590
But Rikka and I have always
held on to one thought.

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:50.570
This one thought from the very beginning.

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:55.980
This one thought we will always hold on to!

00:21:57.940 --> 00:22:05.950
"EVEN THOUGH I'M IN CHUNIBYO,
I STILL WANT LOVE!"

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:05.950
THE END
